[ID 21] Testing: Target coverage rate (KPI002) by brand and country in 2025
Determined intent: data_handler
Instantiated handler: DataHandler
[DataHandler] SQL Generated: SELECT 
    DG.geo_name AS country,
    DB.brand_name AS brand,
    FC.kpi002_target_coverage_pct AS target_coverage_rate
FROM 
    FACT_Coverage FC
JOIN 
    DIM_Geography DG ON FC.geo_id = DG.geo_id
JOIN 
    DIM_Brand DB ON FC.brand_id = DB.brand_id
JOIN 
    DIM_Time DT ON FC.time_id = DT.time_id
WHERE 
    DT.year = 2025
GROUP BY 
    DG.geo_name, 
    DB.brand_name, 
    FC.kpi002_target_coverage_pct
ORDER BY 
    country, 
    brand;
Handler response: This response provides a complete overview of the data model, including schema, data, and KPIs for a pharmaceutical commercial data platform.

 schema context: NovaCarta Pharma EMEA Commercial Data Platform. Technical Data Dictionary & Schema Documentation.

The data model is designed as a star schema with 6 dimension tables and 8 fact tables, enabling brand-level sales aggregation with indication-level interaction tracking.

The schema is classified as follows:

| Table Name | Type | Records | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| DIM_Geography | Dimension | 287 | Five-level geographic hierarchy for EMEA |
| DIM_Brand | Dimension | 15 | Brand master data (15 brands across 4 TAs) |
| DIM_Brand_Indication | Dimension | 20 | Brand-indication bridge (20 indications, multi-indication support) |
| DIM_Time | Dimension | 36 | Calendar time: Jan 2023 - Dec 2025 |
| DIM_Employee | Dimension | 588 | Sales force and medical affairs personnel |
| DIM_Account | Dimension | 1,732 | HCP and HCO master data (no target_class - see FACT_Account_Metrics) |
| FACT_Interactions | Fact | 189,953 | Individual HCP interactions with indication-level tracking |
| FACT_Coverage | Fact | 10,270 | Monthly HCP coverage metrics |
| FACT_Performance | Fact | 15,070 | Monthly employee performance |
| FACT_Sales | Fact | 124,886 | Monthly HCO-level sales with market data |
| FACT_Account_Metrics | Fact | 33,400 | Quarterly account-level metrics (includes target_class) |
| FACT_KPI_Summary | Fact | 52,170 | Consolidated KPI values per country/brand/quarter |
| FACT_Sample_Management | Fact | 13,982 | Product sample delivery tracking |
| DIM_Brand_Indication | Dimension | 20 | Indication belongs to brand |

The KPIs provided in this response are:

